de the peer's driver-owned exam file.\n\nFor the next session: if a future exam here wants to name the Proof's `Run:` command in prose, it cannot spell the runner literally anywhere under `tests/state-exams` — name the file and let the Proof block carry the command.","created_at":"2026-09-17T04:58:11.966030089Z"},"created_at":"2026-09-17T04:58:11.968Z"}
